#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports-dev.md:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`init-format-repo` writes `package.yaml`, the `metadata/` tables, the "
"`content/` tree and an empty `tests/`, then validates the generated "
"`package.yaml` against its JSON schema and says so. It is a skeleton, not"
" a working repository: it supports no format until you add one. See "
"{doc}`../../guides/formats/repository` for what each generated file is."
msgstr ""

